{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIwL0FjY29tcGxpY2UlMjAlMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Accomplice","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/1S9jXlNiamObi1esuBgImbOhsEB.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/as2mFn1iLDECZscrhWgoqtOubIt.jpg","description":"It’s a moment time-stamped in our brains. Maybe it was a birthday gift. Or perhaps you saved paycheck after paycheck to finally purchase one. However you met your first bicycle, it was the pedal strokes that came afterward that hooked you onto something intangible. Adventure. Connection. Freedom. From the producers of UnReal and the director of Where The Trail Ends comes Accomplice, an homage to all the crazy adventures and crazier comrades that result from our finest sidekick. On the surface, Accomplice takes you to mind blowing locations across the globe with the world’s top riders. But beyond that, Teton Gravity Research’s latest film celebrates how the bicycle is more than just a mode of transportation - it’s a vehicle for the human spirit.\n\nReleased 8 Jul 2020 · US · Language: English · 52 min\nStudio: Teton Gravity Research\n\nOn your server — Audio: English · Subtitle files: English","releaseInfo":"2020","genres":["Documentary","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.7","imdb_id":"tt13947978","moviedb_id":751267,"tmdbId":751267,"runtime":"52 min","cast":["Andreu Lacondeguy","Brandon Semenuk","Cam McCaul"],"director":["Jeremy Grant"],"writer":["Jeremy Grant"],"released":"2020-07-08T00:00:00.000Z","country":"US","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Jeremy Grant","character":"Director"},{"name":"Andreu Lacondeguy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bEhOy21DpQwN1MAHVNzwDlQuhYL.jpg"},{"name":"Brandon Semenuk","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hFYWD6dXhhVdqtDvzY50PsW15Hc.jpg"},{"name":"Cam McCaul","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sNq6Fv2aeQmG3fYi345Vt7zqzmM.jpg"}]},"trailers":[{"source":"5guNEvmQrcQ","type":"Trailer"}]